<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">Support the Institute</h1><p class="ref-lede">The Epoch Institute is free to read, free of ads and free of paywalls: more than 33,000 encyclopedia entries, over 700 profiles, an atlas, daily games and printable worksheets. Readers&#8217; support keeps it that way.</p></header>
<section class="ws-guide-sec sup-cta"><p class="sup-btns"><a class="hero-cta" href="https://ko-fi.com/the_epoch_institute" rel="noopener" data-ga="support_click" data-ga-src="support-once">Support once on Ko-fi</a> <a class="hero-cta hero-cta-secondary" href="https://ko-fi.com/the_epoch_institute" rel="noopener" data-ga="support_click" data-ga-src="support-monthly">Become a monthly Friend</a></p><p class="sup-note">Ko-fi takes the payment (card, Apple Pay, Google Pay or PayPal). Any amount helps; a coffee&#8217;s worth a month keeps a game running for a year.</p></section>
<section class="ws-guide-sec"><h2 class="ref-sec-title">What your support pays for</h2><ul><li><b>The server and its speed</b>: hosting, the domain and the delivery network that makes pages open quickly around the world.</li><li><b>New work</b>: new profiles, encyclopedia entries, songs, speeches and essays, each checked against its sources before it goes up.</li><li><b>The daily games</b>: a new Daily Ten, Connections, Crossword, Who Said It?, song quiz and Six Degrees every day, planned a year ahead.</li><li><b>Free teaching material</b>: the worksheets and printable quizzes in the <a href="/teachers/">Teachers&#8217; Corner</a>.</li></ul></section>
<section class="ws-guide-sec" id="friends"><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Friends of the Institute</h2><p>Monthly supporters are the Institute&#8217;s Friends. With your permission, your name appears here, and you hear first about new releases.</p><p class="sup-friends">Be the first Friend of the Institute.</p></section>
<section class="ws-guide-sec"><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Other ways to help, free</h2><ul><li>Sign up for the <a href="/#newsletter-section">weekly newsletter</a>, and play the <a href="/games">daily games</a>.</li><li>Share a page you liked: every page has a Share button.</li><li>Tell a teacher about the <a href="/teachers/">Teachers&#8217; Corner</a>.</li><li>Spotted a mistake? <a href="/contact?topic=correction">Suggest a correction</a>. Know a subject well? <a href="/contributors">Write for the Institute</a>.</li></ul></section>
<section class="ws-guide-sec"><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Good to know</h2><p>The Institute is run by an individual, not a registered charity: support is not a charitable donation and carries no tax relief. Payments, receipts and refunds are handled by Ko-fi. See <a href="/terms">Terms</a> and <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>.</p></section>
